f5e319def9aafb361290cc42e7c771d0ff5d9209e2eb0c220c2af2bc349a82","file":"preprints/Symplectic-Ball-Packings-in-Higher-Dimensions-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":18,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"70f0eb469836a538f8fd7ae8f972137e2fb031308067ed5163dbcefc1f51718d","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Symplectic-Ball-Packings-in-Higher-Dimensions-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:ecf5e319def9aafb361290cc42e7c771d0ff5d9209e2eb0c220c2af2bc349a82","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Symplectic-Ball-Packings-in-Higher-Dimensions-September-23-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L18"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{intro:main}\nLet \\(n\\ge3\\) and \\(k\\ge1\\) be integers. For positive real numbers\n\\(R,R_1,\\ldots,R_k\\), there exists a symplectic embedding\n\\[\n \\bigsqcup_{i=1}^k B^{2n}(R_i)\n \\hookrightarrow \\Int B^{2n}(R)\n\\]\nif and only if\n\\begin{equation}\\label{intro:inequalities}\n \\sum_{i=1}^k R_i^n<R^n,\n \\qquad\n R_i+R_j<R\\quad (1\\le i<j\\le k).\n\\end{equation}"}
